{"skill":{"slug":"superdesign","displayName":"SuperDesign"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767719074735,"changelog":"Frontend design guidelines based on SuperDesign patterns","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":6178,"sha256":"12cbb694b936cadbf025fcb2afedcbaa73553c4adc34d5d338b0c4fbc22f4abb","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1664,"sha256":"b2395e57c06d59cf56eb2f9cccf63bc82bbe20eed26ab4e933ea2e8744f85f1a","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789015046517,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"2a8b1e71d12cc7834dc0590764d7ea9fdd8644d37704f70a52f832f19f9d78e8","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/2a8b1e71d12cc7834dc0590764d7ea9fdd8644d37704f70a52f832f19f9d78e8","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: superdesign\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle provides comprehensive guidelines for an AI agent on frontend design principles, including layout, theming, animation, and implementation. All instructions and code snippets, such as CDN links for Tailwind CSS, Flowbite, and Lucide icons in `SKILL.md`, are presented as examples for the agent to generate as part of its design output, not for the agent to execute in its own environment. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, prompt injection attempts to subvert the agent, or obfuscation. The content is entirely aligned with its stated purpose of frontend design.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159655050},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789015046517},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward frontend design guide, with a notable but disclosed prototype-CDN supply-chain caveat.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The guidance includes third-party CDN snippets for Tailwind, Flowbite, and Lucide, which is common for prototypes but should not be treated as production-safe without pinning and integrity controls.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Only a Markdown skill file was present, with no executable scripts, package install steps, hooks, or runtime bootstrap behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to helping an agent design and implement frontend UI; no role override, hidden directive, memory write, credential handling, or unrelated behavior was found.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, background workers, local profile/session access, or cross-session modification behavior was present.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact provides UI design workflow, theme, animation, responsive, accessibility, and component guidance aligned with its frontend-design purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"This appears safe to install as design guidance. Treat the CDN snippets as prototype examples only; for production, use locked package dependencies, pinned versions, bundled assets, or SRI-protected CDN resources.","findings":"[T03] expected: The CDN examples are purpose-aligned frontend implementation guidance, not skill-install-time execution; however, mutable or integrity-unverified CDN URLs such as Tailwind CDN and lucide@latest create a supply-chain risk if copied into production applications.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789015046517}}}}}